MODULE: ShareRespectedSweepIgnoresReservation
TARGET: ShareRespected
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a sweep takes physical capacity without checking its share
PERTURBS: GcPass
BOUNDS: LeafCount = 2, Ceiling = 2

--- FIND
        IF CanAdmit("sweep") THEN DriveStart(l, "sweep") ELSE DriveRefused(l, "sweep")
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: physical capacity is not a GC reservation.
        IF free > 0 THEN DriveStart(l, "sweep") ELSE DriveRefused(l, "sweep")
--- END
